# Files Prettier must not reformat on save in VSCodium. The repo's style is in .prettierrc.json
# (2 spaces, like .editorconfig); without it the repo would inherit the global ~/.prettierrc.json,
# which uses tabs.

# Nested lists take 4 spaces (.claude/rules/documentation.md) and Prettier realigns them to 2.
# tools/check.sh watches their structure.
*.md

# Byte for byte the same in dotfiles-windows: reformatting it here would split the two copies.
10-shell/oh-my-posh/capr4n.omp.json

# lazy.nvim writes this lock file.
30-editor/nvim/.config/nvim/lazy-lock.json
